## SECTION 5: EVIDENCE-BOUND OUTPUTS

Every extraction decision must cite its source:

| Decision Type | Evidence Format |
|---------------|----------------|
| Element count | "Counted {N} `<INVOKE>` steps in `{path}/flow.xml`" |
| Attribute value | "Extracted `svc_type=flow` from `{path}/node.ndf`" |
| Classification | "Classified as docType — `rec_fields` present, no `svc_type` in `{path}/node.ndf`" |
| Missing data | "⚠️ ASSUMPTION: {value} — Attribute `{attr}` not found in `{path}/node.ndf`" |
| Gap entry | "GAP: Service `{name}` invoked in `{flow}` but not present in scanned project" |
| Not derivable | "Not derivable from provided artifacts" |

> If you cannot cite an artifact file and element, flag as assumption. Never present inferences as confirmed extractions.

